<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pep Boys cut to reduce.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pep Boys cut to reduce.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards said Monday it had cut its rating on the shares of Pep Boys--Manny, Moe &amp; Jack to reduce from buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock fell Friday after the company reported second quarter earnings significantly below Wall Street estimates.</p>
<p>-- Pep Boys was up 1/8 to 27 Monday afternoon.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk))</p>
</text>
